              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P3 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P3-lightgrey?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Add the missing negation before \u201cse eligieron horas\u201d**\n\nIn the Spanish guide, `se eligieron horas` affirmatively says that times were selected, contradicting the surrounding claim that the form was only viewed and nothing was changed. Add `ni` before this clause (for example, `No se toc\u00f3 el interruptor, ni se eligieron horas ni se guard\u00f3`) so Spanish readers receive the intended capture-safety explanation.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
              "url": "https://github.com/hellotext/help/pull/339#discussion_r4159119350",
              "path": "_i18n/es/team/understanding-response-times.md",
              "originalCommit": {
                "oid": "18b4c8fe43d3bd98d34cdc79302cf55a6ed278ab"
              }
            },
            {
